    #      directory <scratch>/p3, the build directory
    #      <home>/.cache/emend-build/m2p3-p3-gate; the base is P2's record commit
    #      ("M2 part 3 P2 record:"); the doc commit and the three code commits by
    #      their full subjects, all beginning "M2 part 3 P3: ".
    #  B2. The doc commit carries specs/0018-rows-and-columns.md and ROADMAP.md
    #      at the hashes planning's message gave; planning's P3 rulings sit in
