    #      manifests, package.rs, package/tests.rs and package/tests/shift.rs;
    #      code commit 2 (the column axis) to package.rs and
    #      package/tests/shift.rs; code commit 3 to the tool's main.rs and
    #      tests/null_rewrite.rs.
    #  D2. The manifests: the phase changes exactly crates/emend/Cargo.toml and
