    #      diffs are printed and their non-comment lines checked against the
    #      feature declaration and the tool's dependency line the spec rules.
    #  E2. The public first lines: pub const joins pub fn (P2 verification ruling
    #      3), each printed beside the line before it when that line is an
    #      attribute (P3 ruling 4 (a)); the two first lines P3 adds are
    #      insert_columns and delete_columns; the six gated items, and only
